# Nothing here any more.
#
# Submission configuration moved into the Apps Script project, where it belongs:
#   - reviewer addresses, sheet ids and the Drive folder id live in
#     Apps Script -> Project Settings -> Script properties
#   - the browser only needs the web app's /exec URL, which goes in
#     assets/js/config.js
#
# There is deliberately no shared secret: the dashboard is a static site, so any
# value it holds is public. See the header comment in google-apps-script.gs.
